    "description": "3356-3358 23rd Street is a charming 2-unit building located just one block from the vibrant Valencia  Street corridor. The property includes a two-bedroom unit and a tenant-occupied three-bedroom unit, offering flexibility for both investors and owner-occupiers. The building also features a lovely backyard, additional bonus space, and a 1-car garage. The lower unit boasts period details,  abundant natural light, and an exclusive back deck, and will be delivered vacant, making it an ideal home for an owner-occupier. With its prime location, residents can enjoy easy access to the array of restaurants, bars, and shops on Valencia, 24th, and Mission Streets. Nearby favorites include Foreign Cinema, Lolinda, El Techo, Beretta, LoLo, El Farolito, El Rio, La Taqueria, and more."
